<title>AUSTRALIA: Port conditions update - Australia - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Australia - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port labour disputes - Australia</p>
<p>Sydney, Dec 19 - Industrial situation 0900 - Members of the MUA employed on tugs went on strike 1200 Dec 18 and returned to work at 2000.</p>
</text>
